TRADEMARK / IP NOTICE

This project's LICENSE above covers ONLY the original source code written by
the author. It does NOT grant any right to the "Command & Conquer" or
"Red Alert" (红色警戒) names, trademarks, artwork, audio, or any other
intellectual property of Electronic Arts Inc.

This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project created for learning and
research purposes. It contains no assets from any commercial game: all
graphics are drawn procedurally with HTML5 Canvas and all sounds are
synthesized with the Web Audio API. Unit and building names that resemble
those of commercial RTS titles are used as descriptive references only, and
anyone redistributing this project should remove or rename them if they have
any concern about trademark use.
